{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9000_place", "source_sha256": "8b61cc3b1f77a56b9822df8387bdd1eed6ea95cf2a05bd1f4c9017629bdd577b", "ja": "ショッピングモール", "zh": "购物中心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9001_p", "source_sha256": "4d76ad717907b8a36360e78fa15b0bff3a1adc73bfe10c564a75b758a2588096", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア撮影。\n環のテーマは『一途系女子』だ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄。\n环的主题是“一心一意系女子”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9002_040tam", "source_sha256": "5be7b9bea335519404699f447719c911baa90acddbbb1bc5fecfbacaad716f17", "ja": "おやぶん！　今日の撮影、追いかけっこするんでしょ？\nたまき、すっごく楽しみなんだ～♪", "zh": "老大！今天的拍摄，要玩追逐游戏对吧？\n环可期待了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9003_p", "source_sha256": "1ec2702beffe2eeb3dc95eda5ea804c8199c00c4aad0cd019211bb9e628f300d", "ja": "追いかけっこ？　……あ、シチュエーションの事か。\nえっとな、環。本当にするわけじゃないんだ。", "zh": "追逐游戏？……啊，是说情境设定啊。\n那个，环，真的不是要来追逐游戏的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9004_040tam", "source_sha256": "73e18402efa1a8dd1d7bfe0dfcff1f6dc7fb9e5fb4e15987cb7d8f05ca7d2d56", "ja": "そうなの？　でも……『いなか？の相手を、\nどこまでも追いかける女の子』って書いてあったよ？", "zh": "是这样吗？可是……上面写着“会一直追赶‘乡下？的对象’的女孩子”哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9005_p", "source_sha256": "26827c10871b41040881f50fd0f366bd597e7108ed4935376cc55f63c843201a", "ja": "ああ、それは『意中』と読むんだよ。大好きすぎて\n追いかける、というか……これは説明が難しいな。", "zh": "啊，那读作“意中”哦。也就是因为太喜欢了才追着不放……这个很难解释啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9006_040tam", "source_sha256": "4692a402a7a5f101b31cc4356399236b9ea713abf48578b1c4e71d7980aaa585", "ja": "？　よくわかんないけど「大好きだぞ～！」\nって思いながら追いかければいいってこと？", "zh": "？虽然不太明白，但就是说，一边想着“最喜欢了哦～！”一边追上去就行了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9007", "source_sha256": "b76234647775f61d79c183b78fd20c43a65260202f92ed46c1c4de3f204b8ce3", "ja": "その通り！", "zh": "没说错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9008", "source_sha256": "a5f9d10b1cf8224762d944aba6556c6167919188a1fae73651982e4886415d43", "ja": "必殺技が必要", "zh": "需要必杀技", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9200_p", "source_sha256": "68e154c87f55a5dd9a77e81b09799ba98bc39eb07b64183baf39a3a075854aee", "ja": "その通り！　大好きな相手とずっと一緒にいたくて\n夢中で追いかけているイメージでやってみよう！", "zh": "没错！试着带着想要和最喜欢的人永远在一起、\n拼命追逐对方的那种感觉来做做看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9201_040tam", "source_sha256": "9601f57d293895ee0b05681e1ecab5ec54bc2975aefdd8f05be3c49331fe4c64", "ja": "わかった、本気で追いかけるぞ！　あ、それなら\nたまき練習したい！　おやぶん、付き合って～！", "zh": "知道了，环要动真格去追了！啊，那这样的话\n环想练习一下！老大，陪环练练嘛～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9202_040tam", "source_sha256": "6f6d95d96c06d7ba482bfe2f6fa410d4b8ee4d7ac0edf36b211d426423cd7bce", "ja": "たまきが「大好きだぞ～！」って追いかけるから、\nおやぶんは思いっきり逃げてね！　絶対捕まえるぞ～♪", "zh": "因为环会一边喊着“最喜欢你啦～！”一边追过来，所以老大要拼尽全力逃跑哦！我绝对会抓到你的～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9300_p", "source_sha256": "68e154c87f55a5dd9a77e81b09799ba98bc39eb07b64183baf39a3a075854aee", "ja": "その通り！　大好きな相手とずっと一緒にいたくて\n夢中で追いかけているイメージでやってみよう！", "zh": "没错！试着带着想要和最喜欢的人永远在一起、\n拼命追逐对方的那种感觉来做做看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9301_040tam", "source_sha256": "39b8067ec493cae017f84e37a40bfa190874d59aa6676ba872c775a453df97b3", "ja": "大好きな相手とずっと一緒にいたくて……？\nうーん……あっ。こぶんみたいにすればいいのか～！", "zh": "想和最喜欢的人一直在一起……？\n唔……啊。像小弟那样做就行了吧～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9302_040tam", "source_sha256": "2cc5244aae7e021d4b7875dd07d16a564ac5d8466a13358bf5ffca5d4908753d", "ja": "こぶんもね、虫とかおもちゃとか、おやぶんとか……\nいっつも追いかけてるもんね！　くふふ♪", "zh": "小弟们也是呀，总是在追虫子、玩具，还有老大……  \n一直追个不停呢！咕呼呼♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9500_p", "source_sha256": "a1bc384857ec06775e0092b275904cbbdb418b239f4c01ded09db100d1f9a574", "ja": "ただ追いかけるんじゃなくて、必殺技が必要なんだ！\n相手が足を止めるくらい、可愛いポーズをしないと。", "zh": "不能光是追，需要有必杀技才行！\n得摆出能让对方停下脚步的可爱姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9501_040tam", "source_sha256": "0af957033fd3fa4d1c26733e7ca8d62b46be413725f4ad16813883f3edbaa9d1", "ja": "必殺技！？　たまき、それやってみたい！\nえっと、かわいいポーズでしょ……。いくぞ～！", "zh": "必杀技！？环也想试试看！\n唔……可爱的姿势是吧……看招～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9502_040tam", "source_sha256": "1531dbb8236d1f14c8f7fc31d41b2c8042afdb3399f82cb229fffb796703ff37", "ja": "「かわいい光線はっしゃ、ビビビビーッ！」\nどうだった、たまきの必殺技！　すごいでしょ～♪", "zh": "“可爱光线发射，哔哔哔——！”\n怎么样，环的必杀技！很厉害吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9600_p", "source_sha256": "a1bc384857ec06775e0092b275904cbbdb418b239f4c01ded09db100d1f9a574", "ja": "ただ追いかけるんじゃなくて、必殺技が必要なんだ！\n相手が足を止めるくらい、可愛いポーズをしないと。", "zh": "不能光是追，需要有必杀技才行！\n得摆出能让对方停下脚步的可爱姿势。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9601_040tam", "source_sha256": "7313b9e435c54f987f95b2041e244a8ca7812a446f290a61096b3dffcf48dac6", "ja": "かわいい必殺技……。\nそれって、まつりとか、ともかが使ってるやつだよね！", "zh": "可爱的必杀技……  \n就是小祭和朋花她们用的那种吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_040tam_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_040tam_9602_040tam", "source_sha256": "d4b944f68cdf7b4da6ca3303ee6b2f405c1cb2d428a023de62ca199cee976850", "ja": "うーん、たまきにもできるかな～？\nそれじゃおやぶん、練習するから見ててね！", "zh": "嗯——环，玉也能做到吗～？\n那亲大人，我要练习了，你看着哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
